Package: claude-usage
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Yigit Salih Emecen <ysalih.emecen@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/YigitSalihEmecen/claude-usage-on-menu-bar
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
 gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-secret-1
Recommends: gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Claude usage limits in your system tray
 See how much Claude usage you have left without opening anything: a progress
 ring and the time until reset sit in the tray, and a panel shows weekly limits,
 per-model limits and the context window of your latest Claude Code session.
 .
 Sign in with your browser, or reuse your existing Claude Code login. Tokens are
 kept in the desktop keyring.
 .
 Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.
